OL,3,GNEWSATwo men arrested after stabbing in
OL,4,ANewtownabbey
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men have been arrested after a man
OL,7,Fwas stabbed in Newtownabbey, County
OL,8,FAntrim.
OL,10,FPolice were called to Glenville Park at
OL,11,Faround 08:25 BST on Saturday and the
OL,12,Finjured man was taken to hospital.
OL,14,FA man in his 20s was arrested on
OL,15,Fsuspicion of grievous bodily harm with
OL,16,Fintent and possession of an offensive
OL,17,Fweapon used with intent.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
